# Regenerated output, deliberately not committed.
#
# ``fork-frontend/`` is the module tree ``scripts/migration/port_frontend.py``
# produces from the fork's own ``console.js`` / ``console.css``. Committing it
# would add ~1 MB of output that is reproducible byte-for-byte from the script
# (that determinism is itself a requirement), and its whitespace is inherited
# verbatim from the monolith — "cleaning" it would break the verbatim-slice
# guarantee the port relies on.
#
# Regenerate with:
#   FORK_MIGRATION_WORKDIR=openspec/changes/adopt-upstream-web-frontend-split/evidence \
#     ./.venv/bin/python scripts/migration/port_frontend.py
#
# What *is* committed alongside this file is the input to the adjudication --
# the 98 hand-decision regions and the per-cluster worklist -- because the
# deferred-increment claim is bounded by that list.
fork-frontend/
